# Images — block loose image files outside app resources (screenshots, docs, etc.)
# App drawable/mipmap PNGs inside src/main/res/ are still tracked.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tiff
*.tif
*.heic
*.heif
*.png
!app/src/main/res/**/*.png
!app/src/*/res/**/*.png
